[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_05_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_05_0010","text":"在平时那个录音室放我下来\n之后就不用管我了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_05_0020","text":"路加……\n在那之前，陪我一下行吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_05_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_05_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_05_0030","text":"偶尔\n也得这样放松一下才行"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_05_0040","text":"切……\n搞什么啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_05_0050","text":"你知道吗？\n听说很快有彗星要靠近了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_05_0060","text":"格外巨大、强烈地闪耀着────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_05_0070","text":"那又怎么了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_05_0080","text":"蠢死了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_05_0090","text":"…………我觉得一定很美"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_05_0100","text":"但反正……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_05_0110","text":"反正\n会消失的────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_05_0120","text":"会没了的\n那种东西"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_05_0130","text":"嗯，也许吧\n但是…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_05_0140","text":"我────\n即便如此，还是觉得它很美"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_05_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_05_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_05_0150","text":"彗星确实总有一天会远去\n从我们眼前消失"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_05_0160","text":"无论什么东西，都会有结束的一天……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_05_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_05_0170","text":"但是，即便如此……\n那份光辉，也一定是珍贵的东西"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_05_0180","text":"不是为了消失────\n才闪耀的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_05_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_05_0190","text":"所以……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_05_0200","text":"路加也是────"}]
